{{!< default}}
{{!-- The TFR rail, first on the page and pinned under the masthead as on the reader (Ian, 2026-09-23). --}}
{{> "faith-received/_tfr-rail"}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Controversies | The Faith Received | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="The controversies as the library's own controversy literature argued them, debate by debate and question by question: Thomists and Scotists (with the Nominalists and the Jesuits), Rome and the Reformation, the Reformed and their adversaries, the Lutherans and the Socinians, each side in his own words from the library's pages." />
<link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel=stylesheet href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap">
<style>
.tfr-tool{--bg:var(--color-bg,#F0F0ED);--fg:var(--color-dark,#1C1C1A);--muted:var(--color-muted,#5A5A56);--border:var(--color-rule,#D8D8D3);--card-bg:var(--color-card,#FFFFFF);--highlight:var(--color-highlight,#E7E7E2);--accent:var(--color-accent,#8A3B2E);--font-display:"EB Garamond",Georgia,serif;--font-body:"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif;
  --s-thomist:#2F5E99;--s-scotist:#7A4E9B;--s-nominalist:#A87420;--s-jesuit:#1F7A80;--s-augustinian:#94506E;--s-other:#7A7A76}
/* THE CONTROVERSIES (2026-10-21, owner: "as comprehensive and deep as possible, like being able to see differences between Thomas vs
   Scotus (like Juan de Rada shows) and more"). v1/enrich/controversies (runs/minimax_1019/controversies): a pair's controversies as the
   library's own controversy literature argued them, question by question, each side in his own words.
   ORGANIZED (2026-10-21, owner: "simply organize this as well … we want to see metaphysical questions and thomas vs scotists"): one row
   grammar for the view (a label, the text, the page at the right): position, arguments, own words, judgment.
   THE DEBATES (2026-10-22, owner: "thomist vs scotus is important, has authors lined up; cajetan has substantial interaction with scotus;
   u need to do a rethink and repass of controversies"): the works of controversy under the debate each pair file names; a debate's own
   view lines its authors up (by school where the school map knows them, else side by side) and gathers its controversies under the
   classic question each answers, each side in its authors' own words. School colours are dots beside the school's name, never alone.
   One type scale: secondary .8rem, body 1rem, headings 1.25 / 1.6 / 2rem. The font tokens name their families outright: a token that
   names itself (--font-display:var(--font-display,…)) is a cycle, so CSS drops it and every heading fell back to the body's size. */
.tfr-tool *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tfr-tool a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool :is(a,button,summary,input):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
.tfr-tool [hidden]{display:none!important}
.tfr-tool .wrap{max-width:66rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1.8rem 1.2rem 4rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font:500 2rem/1.2 var(--font-display);margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .lede{max-width:70ch;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.2rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ct{color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.3 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .sr{position:absolute;left:-9999px}
.tfr-tool .sc-thomist{--sc:var(--s-thomist)}.tfr-tool .sc-scotist{--sc:var(--s-scotist)}.tfr-tool .sc-nominalist{--sc:var(--s-nominalist)}.tfr-tool .sc-jesuit{--sc:var(--s-jesuit)}.tfr-tool .sc-augustinian{--sc:var(--s-augustinian)}.tfr-tool .sc-othermedieval{--sc:var(--s-other)}
.tfr-tool .dot{display:inline-block;flex:none;width:.6rem;height:.6rem;margin-right:.45rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sc,var(--s-other));vertical-align:.08em}
.tfr-tool .sch{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.tfr-tool .pairs{margin:0 0 1.6rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;padding:.65rem .1rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary>span:first-child{flex:none;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::after{content:"";flex:none;width:.42rem;height:.42rem;border-right:1.5px solid currentColor;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;transform:translateY(-.15rem) rotate(45deg);margin-left:.15rem}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary::after{transform:translateY(.1rem) rotate(-135deg)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary .cur{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font:1rem/1.3 var(--font-body);text-align:right;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;min-width:0}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary .cur{display:none}
.tfr-tool .pg-groups{columns:17rem 3;column-gap:2.2rem;padding:.2rem 0 .8rem}
.tfr-tool .pg-group{break-inside:avoid;margin:0 0 1.2rem}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2{margin:0 0 .25rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.8rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.2rem .5rem;margin:0 -.5rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--border);text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl[aria-current="page"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);text-decoration:none}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2 a.dl[aria-current="page"] .ct{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .pg-group ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.8rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.42rem .5rem;margin:0 -.5rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl[aria-current="page"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl[aria-current="page"] .ct{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .pg-also{margin:.1rem 0 .45rem;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .pg-also a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pair{margin:0 0 1.4rem}
.tfr-tool .pair h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .45rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .pair h2 .ct,.tfr-tool .deb-head h2 .ct{margin-left:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);gap:.3rem 1.1rem;margin:0;max-width:72ch}
.tfr-tool .lab>div{display:contents}
.tfr-tool .lab dt{color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.95 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(15rem,21rem) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.8rem;align-items:start}
.tfr-tool .nav{position:sticky;top:.8rem;max-height:calc(100vh - 1.6rem);overflow:auto}
.tfr-tool .find{width:100%;padding:.5rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:1rem var(--font-body);margin:0 0 .6rem}
.tfr-tool .find::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.35rem;margin:0 0 .8rem}
